    name: 'Summer Stampede Western Art & Gear Show',
    title: 'Summer Stampede Western Art & Gear Show',
    description:
      'Put on your best duds and dancing boots for an evening of music, food, friendship, and art at the 11th annual Summer Stampede Western Art & Gear Show, presented by Capital Farm Credit. This beloved event features delicious cuisine from Las Brisas Southwestern Steakhouse, live music by Jake Hooker & the Outsiders, and an impressive display of Western art and gear from renowned artists and makers — with the chance to take home a special piece. Join the fun on Saturday, June 7, 2025, from 5:30 to 11:00 p.m. at the National Ranching Heritage Center in Lubbock, Texas. Tickets are $100 for Ranching Heritage Association members, $135 for the general public, and $1,500 for a reserved table of eight. Tickets sell out every year, so be sure to get yours soon! For more details, art previews, and ticket purchases, visit summerstampede.com.',
