    timezone: 'CDT',
    description:
      'Hark! Step into the whimsical chaos of the Feast of Fools at the Third Annual Hub City Renaissance Faire! Embrace the playful spirit of this medieval tradition, where rules are tossed aside, and society’s norms are flipped upside down in a whirlwind of laughter, mischief, and colorful chaos. The Feast of Fools invites all—from jesters to nobles—to join in the fun with spontaneous performances, quirky games, and a jubilant celebration of life’s absurdity. How to dress for the feast? Channel the extravagant costumes of the past with bold, mismatched patterns, oversized collars, feathered hats, caps and bells, and quirky props like juggling balls or staffs. Whether you go as a jester, a mischievous clown, or even a king or queen in disguise, the more outrageous, the better! This is your chance to break free from the ordinary and embrace your wildest, most whimsical self. Interested in joining us as a vendor? Stay tuned for more details coming your way soon! Important Reminder: All vendors will receive official email notifications from LHUCA prior to any payment requests. LHUCA will never request payment through social media or unaffiliated email addresses.',
