    name: 'Water for Elephants',
    title: 'Water for Elephants',
    startTime: '2026-01-17T20:00:00.000Z',
    endTime: null,
    timezone: 'CST',
    description:
      'Tickets for the 2025–2026 Broadway season are currently available exclusively through season memberships, with single tickets going on sale in Fall 2025. The New York Times praises this production as a gorgeously imaginative Broadway musical full of wonders. Based on the critically acclaimed bestselling novel, the show brings the story to thrilling, dazzling life, earning a Critic’s Pick designation and being described as stunning, emotional, heart-filled and gorgeously imaginative by The New York Times. The story follows a young man who, after losing what matters most, jumps onto a moving train unsure of where it will take him. He finds a new home with the remarkable crew of a traveling circus and discovers a life—and love—beyond his wildest dreams. Seen through the eyes of his older self, his adventure serves as a poignant reminder that if you choose the ride, life can begin again at any age. Directed by Tony Award-nominated Jessica Stone, the huge, heart-filling production features a book adapted from Sara Gruen’s novel by three-time Tony nominee Rick Elice, and a soaring score by the acclaimed PigPen Theatre Co. Audiences are invited to experience the spellbinding entertainment of Water for Elephants, hailed as the best new musical on Broadway by Theatermania.',
