    name: 'Youth Artist Guild Lubbock Performing Arts Season 2024-2025',
    title: 'Youth Artist Guild Lubbock Performing Arts Season 2024-2025',
    description:
      'The Youth Artist Guild Lubbock Performing Arts 2024-2025 Season is made possible in part through a grant from the City of Lubbock, as recommended by Civic Lubbock, Inc. This family-friendly program offers performances suitable for audiences of all ages. The season begins with Heist Quest (October 18-20 & 25-27), a fun tale about the kingdom’s second most notorious thief hired to kidnap a princess, only to face magical creatures and unexpected challenges. Next is How to Enchant a Bookshop (December 13-15), where Margie, struggling to keep her bookshop open, teams up with Feonora, a fairy-in-training who accidentally brings storybook characters to life, causing magical chaos. In February (14-16 & 21-23), The Westing Game unfolds as the residents of Sunset Towers are drawn into a thrilling mystery to uncover the killer of an eccentric millionaire through a puzzling game. The season concludes with The Jungle Book (April 25-27 & May 2-4), following the adventures of Mowgli, a boy raised by wolves, as he learns the Law of the Jungle and confronts the fearsome tiger Shere Khan. For more information, visit www.yaglubbock.org.',
