    title: 'Summer Stampede Western Art & Gear Show',
    description:
      'Put on your best duds and dancing boots for an evening of music, food, friendship, and art!\nThe 11th annual Summer Stampede Western Art & Gear Show presented by Capital Farm Credit is a favorite event of the year! Enjoy delicious food from Las Brisas Southwestern Steakhouse, kick up your heels to the music of Jake Hooker & the Outsiders, peruse Western art and gear from renowned artists and gear makers (and maybe even bring one home!), and chat with the artists. We look forward to seeing you there!\n𝗗𝗮𝘁𝗲: Saturday, June 7, 2025\n𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲: 5:30 - 11:00 p.m.\n𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: National Ranching Heritage Center | 3121 4th Street Lubbock, Texas 79409\n𝗣𝗿𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗻𝗴:\nRanching Heritage Association Members - $100\nGeneral Public - $135\nReserved Table for 8 – $1,500\n𝙏𝙞𝙘𝙠𝙚𝙩𝙨 𝙨𝙚𝙡𝙡 𝙤𝙪𝙩 𝙚𝙫𝙚𝙧𝙮 𝙮𝙚𝙖𝙧, 𝙨𝙤 𝙜𝙚𝙩 𝙮𝙤𝙪𝙧𝙨 𝙨𝙤𝙤𝙣!\nLearn more, view art pieces, and purchase tickets at summerstampede.com',
