    name: 'Does Your Lover Feel Distant? This Fixed Mine',
    title: 'Does Your Lover Feel Distant? This Fixed Mine',
    description:
      "For weeks, I felt like a stranger in my own relationship. He stopped calling like he used to, barely responded to texts, and when we were together, it felt like he was a million miles away. I tried everything — heart-to-heart talks, giving him space, even ignoring him — but nothing worked… until I tried something different.\n\nOut of frustration, I turned to a spiritual solution I had only heard whispers about. I scanned a code that promised emotional reconnection through energy work and ancient love rituals. Within hours, he messaged me with warmth I hadn't felt in months.\n\nIf your partner feels emotionally distant or cold, don't ignore that feeling. You deserve answers — and real change.",
